=== (a) form structure: F = m*n*(m-n)*(m+n)*(m^4-6m^2n^2+n^4) ===
  factor of m^4-6m^2n^2+n^4 over Q (n=1): [t^2 - 2*t - 1, 1; t^2 + 2*t - 1, 1]
  gcd(quartic, quartic') = 1  (const => squarefree)
  m^4-6m^2n^2+n^4 over Q(sqrt2): [t + Mod(-w - 1, w^2 - 2), 1; t + Mod(-w + 1, w^2 - 2), 1; t + Mod(w - 1, w^2 - 2), 1; t + Mod(w + 1, w^2 - 2), 1]
  => quartic is REDUCIBLE over Q as (t^2-2t-1)(t^2+2t-1) = F5*F6;
     its further splitting into LINEAR factors needs Q(sqrt2).
  Six distinct factors m, n, m-n, m+n, F5, F6 => F separable of degree 8.

